id: pm-context-option-contract-1114
title: Adopt pm-cli option contract and current pm-toolchain
description: Supersede Dependabot PR 227 while retaining invalid guard refusals and proving normalized check paths are enforced.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: dependencies,"gh:unbraind/pm-context#227","gh:unbraind/pm-context#228"
